Goal: Opening the drawer moves focus into it, so the user can tab to filter etc.

Thus the issue: When the drawer is opened via showModal(), focus is not moved to the first focusable element (maybe the close button). According to ARIA authoring practices for dialog, focus should be moved to the dialog (typically first focusable element) when opened.

